1
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:08,920
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:34,880 --> 00:01:38,920
ADAPTED FROM <i>JIA JIN CHAI</i>, ORIGINAL NOVEL
BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

3
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:44,160
Your Ladyship.

4
00:01:44,240 --> 00:01:45,600
There's been a murder at the estate.

5
00:01:45,680 --> 00:01:47,400
We should turn the suspect
over to the authorities.

6
00:01:47,480 --> 00:01:50,080
Even if we question the suspect,
vigilante justice is not permitted.

7
00:01:50,160 --> 00:01:51,240
Why not?

8
00:01:54,880 --> 00:01:57,280
Your Ladyship, this is your land.

9
00:01:57,360 --> 00:01:58,000
AS THE SUN RISES

10
00:01:58,080 --> 00:01:59,800
Even the local officials
need your permission

11
00:02:00,440 --> 00:02:02,040
before they can arrest a suspect here.

12
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:05,920
Feng Sheng,
what if you hand over the suspect

13
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,800
and someone kills him to keep him quiet?

14
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:10,400
There's more to this than meets the eye.

15
00:02:11,039 --> 00:02:12,680
We need to question
more than just the craftsmen.

16
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:16,720
Every maid serving Her Ladyship
must be questioned, too.

17
00:02:18,080 --> 00:02:19,440
I don't know anything!

18
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:20,560
I don't know anything!

19
00:02:20,640 --> 00:02:22,640
- I don't know anything!
- I'm innocent!

20
00:02:22,720 --> 00:02:24,000
I'm innocent!

21
00:02:26,880 --> 00:02:30,080
Gejin, you share a room with Chilan.

22
00:02:30,160 --> 00:02:32,080
She never came back last night.

23
00:02:32,600 --> 00:02:34,000
And you didn't notice?

24
00:02:34,080 --> 00:02:37,720
Your Ladyship,
Chilan, Siyu, and I share a room.

25
00:02:38,320 --> 00:02:40,640
Chilan was supposed to be on night patrol.

26
00:02:40,720 --> 00:02:42,080
When I got up last night,
she wasn't there.

27
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:45,440
I just assumed she was still on duty.

28
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:47,000
Chilan is very hardworking.

29
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:48,000
Even when she's not on duty,

30
00:02:48,080 --> 00:02:51,320
she often goes out alone at night
to inspect every corner of the estate.

31
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:53,840
She checks that the tea room stove is out.

32
00:02:53,920 --> 00:02:55,760
She's the last to bed and first to rise.

33
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:57,520
But somehow, she…

34
00:02:57,600 --> 00:02:59,440
Question all of you together,

35
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:01,440
and we'll find out, won't we?

36
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:04,120
We've gotten to the bottom of it.

37
00:03:05,320 --> 00:03:07,200
A bandit had slipped into the estate.

38
00:03:07,720 --> 00:03:12,720
He was stealing valuables
when Chilan caught him, so he killed her.

39
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:14,960
Just a bandit? That's all?

40
00:03:15,040 --> 00:03:16,360
What else could it be?

41
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:18,640
We've taken in so many refugees.

42
00:03:18,720 --> 00:03:19,600
All sorts of people have come here.

43
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:22,960
I've ordered the steward
to question every refugee.

44
00:03:23,880 --> 00:03:25,160
We can't let another thief slip in.

45
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:35,320
You're dismissed.

46
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:42,720
You two may leave as well.

47
00:03:54,720 --> 00:03:58,200
Wei Rao, there's something important
you need to see tonight.

48
00:03:58,960 --> 00:03:59,840
Tonight?

49
00:03:59,920 --> 00:04:01,880
Yes. We'll go after dark.

50
00:04:46,560 --> 00:04:47,800
They're copper coins.

51
00:04:47,880 --> 00:04:52,040
The craftsman named Ben
is actually a servant of the Han family.

52
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:54,120
Once the edict came down,
the estate changes hands.

53
00:04:54,200 --> 00:04:56,200
the Hans only had time
to move some of their wealth.

54
00:04:56,280 --> 00:04:59,640
He was ordered to stay behind
and guard what was left in the vault.

55
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:04,920
Last night, he crawled out of the cellar
and ran into Chilan.

56
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:06,240
Afraid she'd discover his secret,

57
00:05:06,320 --> 00:05:07,960
he killed her without mercy.

58
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:11,000
The Han family! Again!

59
00:05:11,960 --> 00:05:13,120
It was so dark.

60
00:05:13,200 --> 00:05:14,320
Chilan might not have seen a thing.

61
00:05:14,920 --> 00:05:17,080
But they knew they were guilty.

62
00:05:17,160 --> 00:05:19,920
They'd rather kill an innocent
than take a chance.

63
00:05:22,080 --> 00:05:24,240
And Chilan wasn't his only victim.

64
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:27,840
There are two more bodies buried
in the woods southeast of the fields.

65
00:05:27,920 --> 00:05:30,560
Seven days ago, a father and son
caught him contacting someone outside,

66
00:05:31,080 --> 00:05:32,320
so he killed them.

67
00:05:33,880 --> 00:05:39,320
If Chilan's body hadn't surfaced,
even more innocent people would have died.

68
00:05:40,400 --> 00:05:42,600
Zhao Bai. Go see what else is in there.

69
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:48,560
Carry these two chests out first.

70
00:05:51,280 --> 00:05:53,640
My Lord, there are
over a dozen more chests inside.

71
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:14,600
No wonder Han Liao
wouldn't leave us alone.

72
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:17,800
So that's what he was after.

73
00:06:18,520 --> 00:06:19,560
What are you going to do with it?

74
00:06:20,160 --> 00:06:21,200
Isn't it obvious?

75
00:06:21,280 --> 00:06:23,400
We've taken in so many refugees.

76
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:24,920
The court's aid barely covers anything.

77
00:06:25,640 --> 00:06:26,720
Clearing new farmland
won't feed them right away.

78
00:06:27,320 --> 00:06:28,840
We have so many hungry mouths to feed.

79
00:06:29,520 --> 00:06:31,960
The Han family's fortune…
It was all stolen from the people.

80
00:06:32,040 --> 00:06:33,520
What's wrong with giving it back to them?

81
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:37,800
Even if you kept every last coin,
would the Han family dare report you?

82
00:06:38,720 --> 00:06:40,880
- They'd have to swallow the loss.
- Qi Zhongkai.

83
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:42,800
Don't act so noble.

84
00:06:42,880 --> 00:06:45,080
Who'd willingly give away
a fortune in gold?

85
00:06:45,160 --> 00:06:46,760
Only a complete fool!

86
00:06:48,120 --> 00:06:49,160
Wei Rao.

87
00:06:50,800 --> 00:06:52,480
This money could feed
and support your people.

88
00:06:53,440 --> 00:06:55,600
Han Liao wouldn't dare
openly demand the gold back.

89
00:06:56,200 --> 00:06:57,560
But he won't just let it go.

90
00:06:58,360 --> 00:06:59,960
If you want to keep this gold,

91
00:07:02,320 --> 00:07:03,400
we'll need a clever plan.

92
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:17,320
Move these gold bars
out of the cellar in batches.

93
00:07:18,600 --> 00:07:19,960
Make sure no outsiders find out.

94
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:24,720
Then seal up the piles of copper coins
exactly as they are.

95
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:31,240
So this vault
contains only gold and copper coins?

96
00:07:32,640 --> 00:07:34,040
Nothing else?

97
00:07:36,720 --> 00:07:37,920
What else would there be?

98
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:39,960
We can make sure there will be.

99
00:07:42,960 --> 00:07:44,920
Zhao Bai, I need you to do something.

100
00:07:48,960 --> 00:07:49,960
Yes, My Lord.

101
00:07:50,480 --> 00:07:52,400
What are you two
being so mysterious about?

102
00:07:53,400 --> 00:07:56,560
There's nothing I love more than gold.

103
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:59,800
Lord Han has given me
such a generous gift.

104
00:08:00,440 --> 00:08:02,880
It's only right that I return the favor.

105
00:08:03,520 --> 00:08:05,000
And the gift I have for him…

106
00:08:09,240 --> 00:08:11,160
I hope he can handle it.

107
00:08:16,080 --> 00:08:19,640
By the heir's orders, no one may approach
the cellar from this day forward!

108
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:21,600
Violators will face military punishment.

109
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:23,000
Yes!

110
00:08:23,080 --> 00:08:24,920
<i>What if Her Ladyship finds out?</i>

111
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:27,120
<i>No. I can't stay here any longer.</i>

112
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:32,600
Lady Li heard what happened at my estate.

113
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:34,960
She worried I
might be short on reliable help,

114
00:08:35,880 --> 00:08:37,120
so she sent Aman to me.

115
00:08:37,799 --> 00:08:40,600
From now on, she'll take Chilan's place.

116
00:08:40,679 --> 00:08:42,159
You'll all follow her orders.

117
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:43,919
Yes, Your Ladyship.

118
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:46,360
Gejin.

119
00:08:46,880 --> 00:08:48,760
Aman is new here.

120
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:49,800
Make sure you show her the ropes.

121
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:51,840
Yes, Your Ladyship.

122
00:08:51,920 --> 00:08:54,160
His Majesty
is visiting Shanglin Park today.

123
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:55,280
I must go there as well.

124
00:08:56,160 --> 00:08:57,160
You all stay and look after the estate.

125
00:08:57,760 --> 00:08:59,240
Now, get back to work.

126
00:08:59,880 --> 00:09:01,400
- Yes, Your Ladyship.
- Yes, Your Ladyship.

127
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:19,960
<i>Your Ladyship,</i>
<i>the compensation for Chilan's family</i>

128
00:09:20,680 --> 00:09:22,120
<i>has been delivered as you instructed.</i>

129
00:09:22,680 --> 00:09:25,920
<i>Aman. I can't trust</i>
<i>the people at this estate.</i>

130
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:28,760
<i>There's someone</i>
<i>I need you to keep an eye on.</i>

131
00:09:59,360 --> 00:10:01,080
I've lost contact with my spy.

132
00:10:01,760 --> 00:10:05,320
I trust you can tell me
what happened at the estate.

133
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:08,320
Her Ladyship had a craftsman arrested.

134
00:10:09,440 --> 00:10:11,280
He… he killed Chilan.

135
00:10:19,560 --> 00:10:21,440
Then why are you running?

136
00:10:28,880 --> 00:10:30,360
Please don't kill me, My Lord!

137
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:32,320
I'll tell you everything!

138
00:10:32,400 --> 00:10:34,400
Tell me everything Her Ladyship
has been doing.

139
00:10:34,480 --> 00:10:36,440
Don't leave out a single detail.

140
00:10:39,520 --> 00:10:42,720
ZHAO

141
00:10:45,720 --> 00:10:47,720
That's amazing.

142
00:10:53,320 --> 00:10:55,240
- Yes, indeed.
- Bravo.

143
00:10:56,600 --> 00:10:59,360
- They've got some real tricks!
- Good moves!

144
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:01,880
Bravo!

145
00:11:02,640 --> 00:11:03,600
- Look at that!
- Wow!

146
00:11:03,680 --> 00:11:05,680
- That's amazing!
- This one's beautiful, too!

147
00:11:22,520 --> 00:11:25,680
- Bravo!
- Bravo!

148
00:11:31,160 --> 00:11:33,480
Such incredible strength! Reward him!

149
00:11:59,440 --> 00:12:01,840
- Enemies!
- Father!

150
00:12:02,440 --> 00:12:04,960
Enemies! Kill!

151
00:12:05,040 --> 00:12:06,720
- Your Majesty!
- Protect His Majesty!

152
00:12:07,720 --> 00:12:08,680
Charge!

153
00:12:12,640 --> 00:12:14,520
- Protect His Majesty!
- Your Majesty, watch out!

154
00:12:14,600 --> 00:12:15,840
- Protect His Majesty!
- Protect His Majesty!

155
00:12:24,520 --> 00:12:25,680
Mother!

156
00:12:26,240 --> 00:12:27,560
Shuo!

157
00:12:45,680 --> 00:12:46,880
Go!

158
00:12:51,160 --> 00:12:53,200
I failed in my duty. Forgive me for
putting you in danger, Your Majesty.

159
00:13:31,600 --> 00:13:32,960
It was a test.

160
00:13:35,280 --> 00:13:37,120
A test for the princes.

161
00:13:53,040 --> 00:13:56,080
FURONG HALL

162
00:13:56,160 --> 00:13:59,720
DEW AND BLOSSOMS

163
00:14:13,200 --> 00:14:15,560
- Leave us.
- Yes, Your Highness.

164
00:14:18,440 --> 00:14:22,240
Mother. These are all rewards
from Grandmother and Father.

165
00:14:22,920 --> 00:14:25,800
But how did you know it was a test?

166
00:14:25,880 --> 00:14:27,240
For the past six months,

167
00:14:27,320 --> 00:14:30,440
officials have repeatedly urged
His Majesty to name a crown prince.

168
00:14:31,320 --> 00:14:34,000
Of His Majesty's four sons,

169
00:14:34,640 --> 00:14:37,680
Prince Jing was adopted by the Empress.

170
00:14:38,720 --> 00:14:40,640
He has the advantage of being the eldest.

171
00:14:40,720 --> 00:14:42,720
But when it comes to governing
and military strategy,

172
00:14:43,240 --> 00:14:44,120
he's nowhere near your equal.

173
00:14:44,840 --> 00:14:47,680
Prince Fu has used
the Wang family's wealth and influence

174
00:14:47,760 --> 00:14:51,000
to win over many court officials
who now speak on his behalf.

175
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:55,480
Liu Shuo is the youngest,
and he's reckless and unruly.

176
00:14:56,360 --> 00:14:59,600
On the surface, he seems
the least fit to inherit the throne.

177
00:15:00,600 --> 00:15:04,880
But he happens to have
a mother who enjoys the Emperor's favor.

178
00:15:05,480 --> 00:15:07,800
The court officials can't agree,

179
00:15:09,240 --> 00:15:11,840
and His Majesty struggles to decide.

180
00:15:14,120 --> 00:15:17,000
Your uncle has been watching closely

181
00:15:17,080 --> 00:15:18,160
for unusual activity
in the palace and army.

182
00:15:18,760 --> 00:15:21,360
He knew His Majesty
would put the princes to the test.

183
00:15:22,320 --> 00:15:24,360
When I become crown prince,

184
00:15:24,440 --> 00:15:26,680
I'll never forget all my grandfather
and uncle have done for me.

185
00:15:30,200 --> 00:15:31,440
Did you see that clearly?

186
00:15:31,520 --> 00:15:34,240
Lady Li had eyes for no one else.

187
00:15:34,760 --> 00:15:35,720
She went straight for Liu Shuo?

188
00:15:38,520 --> 00:15:40,920
The assassins were after the throne.

189
00:15:41,600 --> 00:15:45,200
Liu Shuo was too close to the danger,
and Wei Rao was too far away.

190
00:15:48,640 --> 00:15:50,920
Then you don't understand people at all.

191
00:15:51,600 --> 00:15:53,760
A child abandoned by her mother

192
00:15:53,840 --> 00:15:56,320
would never forgive her a second time.

193
00:15:58,040 --> 00:16:02,560
It looks like Zhaoyang Palace
is in for another family feud.

194
00:16:06,600 --> 00:16:09,760
Yes. You're very wise, Mother.

195
00:16:10,880 --> 00:16:12,000
Be gentle.

196
00:16:13,960 --> 00:16:16,440
Ow! That hurts…

197
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:21,880
SPLENDID AS BLOSSOMS

198
00:16:21,960 --> 00:16:22,800
What did His Majesty say?

199
00:16:23,400 --> 00:16:25,200
He's ordered that no one
be allowed to see him.

200
00:16:30,240 --> 00:16:31,400
How is it?

201
00:16:31,480 --> 00:16:32,880
Come here. Let Mother have a look.

202
00:16:32,960 --> 00:16:34,080
It hurts.

203
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:36,440
His Majesty really went too far.

204
00:16:36,520 --> 00:16:39,640
If he wanted to test his sons' character,
he should've warned us first.

205
00:16:40,240 --> 00:16:41,400
Look what he's put you through.

206
00:16:42,120 --> 00:16:43,800
My poor boy!

207
00:16:43,880 --> 00:16:45,240
If he'd practiced his fighting skills,

208
00:16:45,320 --> 00:16:47,200
he could've been the hero today.

209
00:16:47,280 --> 00:16:49,640
Lady Li, you keep spoiling your son

210
00:16:50,360 --> 00:16:52,320
without thinking about the trouble ahead.

211
00:16:53,760 --> 00:16:55,160
His Majesty refuses to see anyone.

212
00:16:55,840 --> 00:16:57,280
He must be upset about what happened.

213
00:16:57,800 --> 00:16:59,120
Shuo is still so young.

214
00:16:59,200 --> 00:17:01,120
He's your own brother.

215
00:17:01,200 --> 00:17:02,520
Instead of worrying about his safety,

216
00:17:02,600 --> 00:17:03,680
all you can think about is scheming.

217
00:17:04,319 --> 00:17:06,400
Besides,
His Majesty deliberately tested them

218
00:17:06,480 --> 00:17:08,319
by ordering the guards
to lower their defenses.

219
00:17:08,400 --> 00:17:10,680
The men they let in
were desperate killers.

220
00:17:10,760 --> 00:17:12,560
And you still wanted him to play the hero?

221
00:17:12,640 --> 00:17:15,000
You might as well wish him dead!

222
00:17:15,839 --> 00:17:17,280
You're so petty, Rao.

223
00:17:17,359 --> 00:17:18,200
You're just jealous.

224
00:17:18,280 --> 00:17:20,760
It was dangerous out there,
and you were too far away.

225
00:17:20,839 --> 00:17:21,839
How could Mother possibly get to you?

226
00:17:23,119 --> 00:17:24,599
If I'd been the one in danger,

227
00:17:24,680 --> 00:17:26,880
would Lady Li
have left her son to save me?

228
00:17:37,920 --> 00:17:39,800
Mother, she resents you.

229
00:17:39,880 --> 00:17:41,280
She's never been on our side.

230
00:17:43,320 --> 00:17:45,360
What did I do to deserve this?

231
00:17:45,960 --> 00:17:48,920
I only scolded Shuo for being lazy
and refusing to practice.

232
00:17:49,000 --> 00:17:49,840
GREAT BLESSINGS, SPRING'S GRACE

233
00:17:49,920 --> 00:17:53,360
She accused me of being petty
and resenting my own brother.

234
00:17:54,720 --> 00:17:56,600
She abandoned me when I was little.

235
00:17:56,680 --> 00:17:58,880
And when danger struck,
she forgot about me again.

236
00:17:59,840 --> 00:18:01,760
Am I not her own flesh and blood?

237
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:04,240
How can a mother favor one child so much?

238
00:18:08,800 --> 00:18:10,200
Rao.

239
00:18:10,280 --> 00:18:13,200
Today, His Majesty turned Lady Li away
outside Xuanshi Palace.

240
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:16,200
Then the Empress Dowager
summoned her for a scolding,

241
00:18:16,280 --> 00:18:18,560
accusing her of raising her son poorly.

242
00:18:19,360 --> 00:18:21,040
She even said that
once the Fourth Prince recovers,

243
00:18:21,120 --> 00:18:22,560
he'll be sent to the army for training.

244
00:18:25,280 --> 00:18:28,920
Lady Li was just upset,
so she took it out on you.

245
00:18:29,720 --> 00:18:30,800
He's utterly incompetent!

246
00:18:33,600 --> 00:18:36,280
Lady Zheng, you heard her yourself.

247
00:18:36,800 --> 00:18:40,320
She blames me for
everything Shuo did wrong.

248
00:18:42,840 --> 00:18:47,240
Well, Shuo
has always lived with his mother.

249
00:18:47,320 --> 00:18:50,000
He's still young,
so naturally she dotes on him.

250
00:18:50,680 --> 00:18:53,640
As his older sister,
you'll have to be understanding.

251
00:18:55,240 --> 00:18:59,360
It breaks my heart
to see a mother and daughter at odds.

252
00:19:00,240 --> 00:19:01,400
Here's what we'll do.

253
00:19:01,480 --> 00:19:04,200
I'll host a banquet tomorrow
and invite Lady Li.

254
00:19:04,840 --> 00:19:07,120
I'll help you two make peace.

255
00:19:07,960 --> 00:19:09,880
A mother and daughter
shouldn't stay angry.

256
00:19:10,480 --> 00:19:12,400
Surely talking it out will settle things.

257
00:19:16,560 --> 00:19:19,320
Thank you, Lady Zheng.

258
00:19:22,960 --> 00:19:25,200
No mother loves all her children equally.

259
00:19:25,280 --> 00:19:28,400
The one she raised herself
will naturally be her favorite.

260
00:19:29,160 --> 00:19:31,080
But she's still your mother.

261
00:19:31,160 --> 00:19:34,400
Say a few kind words to her,
and she'll come around.

262
00:19:35,600 --> 00:19:39,400
Unlike me.
Being a royal daughter-in-law isn't easy.

263
00:19:39,480 --> 00:19:42,480
I have to watch every word
around my mother-in-law.

264
00:19:43,080 --> 00:19:44,040
I can't afford a single mistake.

265
00:19:44,760 --> 00:19:46,400
When I first married into the family,

266
00:19:47,040 --> 00:19:49,280
she looked down on my humble background.

267
00:19:49,800 --> 00:19:51,800
I had no powerful father
or brothers to support me.

268
00:19:51,880 --> 00:19:53,520
She found fault with everything I did.

269
00:19:54,600 --> 00:19:55,960
Fortunately, later on…

270
00:19:56,040 --> 00:19:57,160
What happened later?

271
00:20:02,480 --> 00:20:04,600
Master Min, who makes immortality elixirs
for the Empress Dowager,

272
00:20:04,680 --> 00:20:05,600
gave me a talisman.

273
00:20:06,200 --> 00:20:08,520
It's meant to mend ties between in-laws

274
00:20:08,600 --> 00:20:10,200
and keep husbands and wives from arguing.

275
00:20:11,040 --> 00:20:12,200
Did it work?

276
00:20:15,760 --> 00:20:17,040
You've been separated
from your family since childhood.

277
00:20:17,680 --> 00:20:18,880
Your family ties have always been fragile.

278
00:20:18,960 --> 00:20:22,080
So I got you a talisman
to strengthen family bonds.

279
00:20:22,760 --> 00:20:24,800
May it help you and your mother reconcile.

280
00:20:25,640 --> 00:20:27,920
Life rarely goes the way we want.

281
00:20:28,000 --> 00:20:31,680
You need to let go of your resentment
and open yourself up to better things.

282
00:20:32,280 --> 00:20:34,760
Please don't be stubborn
and turn against your mother.

283
00:20:34,840 --> 00:20:37,320
She's the one you can truly rely on.

284
00:20:41,760 --> 00:20:42,600
I understand.

285
00:20:45,520 --> 00:20:46,480
Thank you, Shu.

286
00:20:49,120 --> 00:20:50,000
JOY AND PEACE

287
00:20:59,200 --> 00:21:00,160
Your Ladyship.

288
00:21:00,240 --> 00:21:02,400
Your Ladyship,
it's a talisman for family harmony.

289
00:21:02,480 --> 00:21:03,600
It's common among folks.

290
00:21:03,680 --> 00:21:04,920
Nothing harmful about it.

291
00:21:07,200 --> 00:21:08,160
That's a relief.

292
00:21:09,680 --> 00:21:12,520
Lady Zheng is hosting a banquet tomorrow.
I must go to the palace.

293
00:21:58,000 --> 00:22:00,680
Hurry up. Go on.

294
00:22:45,200 --> 00:22:48,560
This pair of jade pendants
was a gift from His Majesty years ago.

295
00:22:49,920 --> 00:22:52,600
I'd like you two cousins to have them.

296
00:22:52,680 --> 00:22:54,040
Consider it my way of thanking

297
00:22:54,120 --> 00:22:56,520
Princess Consort Duan
for helping us reconcile.

298
00:22:57,240 --> 00:23:00,200
Lady Li, you're too kind.
I don't deserve such praise.

299
00:23:01,240 --> 00:23:02,720
Rao is my own cousin.

300
00:23:02,800 --> 00:23:03,920
I only want what's best for her.

301
00:23:04,680 --> 00:23:07,560
We may have kept Rao's past from others,

302
00:23:07,640 --> 00:23:09,560
but there's no hiding it from you two.

303
00:23:09,640 --> 00:23:12,920
My daughter
was brought back from outside the palace.

304
00:23:13,000 --> 00:23:14,840
There are many court rules
she doesn't know.

305
00:23:15,360 --> 00:23:17,800
I'm grateful Lady Zheng
has taken her under her wing.

306
00:23:17,880 --> 00:23:19,480
I should be the one thanking you.

307
00:23:20,160 --> 00:23:22,840
Actually, I envy you.

308
00:23:23,600 --> 00:23:26,320
You have such a bright,
thoughtful daughter.

309
00:23:26,400 --> 00:23:28,360
Unlike my son.

310
00:23:28,440 --> 00:23:31,400
All he ever does is practice fighting.

311
00:23:31,920 --> 00:23:33,200
Even on his days off,

312
00:23:33,840 --> 00:23:35,800
his father summons him to attend court.

313
00:23:36,640 --> 00:23:39,040
All I have is my daughter-in-law
to keep me company.

314
00:23:39,560 --> 00:23:41,520
As capable as she is,

315
00:23:42,440 --> 00:23:44,400
she's no substitute for a loving daughter.

316
00:23:46,480 --> 00:23:50,000
Yinggu. Is my gift for Lady Zheng ready?

317
00:23:50,840 --> 00:23:51,680
Bring it here at once.

318
00:23:52,840 --> 00:23:53,720
Bring it in.

319
00:23:54,240 --> 00:23:57,440
DEW AND BLOSSOMS

320
00:24:01,000 --> 00:24:02,560
What's all this?

321
00:24:03,520 --> 00:24:05,560
Shu, please open it and see.

322
00:24:24,160 --> 00:24:25,720
They're here.

323
00:24:28,200 --> 00:24:29,520
Rao.

324
00:24:38,520 --> 00:24:39,920
All of you, leave!

325
00:24:44,920 --> 00:24:47,720
Lady Li, I hosted this banquet
out of kindness

326
00:24:47,800 --> 00:24:49,160
to help you make peace.

327
00:24:49,240 --> 00:24:51,520
And this is how you repay me?

328
00:24:51,600 --> 00:24:53,800
Lady Zheng,
you've certainly thought of everything.

329
00:24:54,880 --> 00:24:57,320
You didn't just help us reconcile.

330
00:24:57,400 --> 00:24:58,920
You also had this palace maid

331
00:24:59,000 --> 00:25:00,280
sneak into the bedchamber
in Zhaoyang Palace

332
00:25:00,360 --> 00:25:01,240
SPLENDID AS BLOSSOMS

333
00:25:01,320 --> 00:25:02,920
and hide something rather interesting.

334
00:25:12,000 --> 00:25:14,000
This is an Enmity Talisman.

335
00:25:14,720 --> 00:25:16,680
One must slay a dam and her pups,

336
00:25:17,280 --> 00:25:19,960
burn their heads and
drink the ashes mixed with water.

337
00:25:20,040 --> 00:25:23,480
Bury the pup's bones far apart,

338
00:25:24,680 --> 00:25:27,920
so mother and child
shall loathe each other for all eternity.

339
00:25:30,200 --> 00:25:32,240
It must be a curse against
the Empress Dowager and His Majesty.

340
00:25:33,440 --> 00:25:34,360
This one is even worse.

341
00:25:35,280 --> 00:25:36,600
A Soul-Stealing Talisman.

342
00:25:37,160 --> 00:25:38,280
It's meant to take lifes.

343
00:25:39,480 --> 00:25:41,680
Whose birth details are written on it?

344
00:25:42,280 --> 00:25:43,880
The Empress Dowager's.

345
00:25:46,600 --> 00:25:47,960
Lady Zheng.

346
00:25:48,040 --> 00:25:50,600
You ordered a palace maid to
hide talismans in Zhaoyang Palace.

347
00:25:50,680 --> 00:25:54,160
Were you trying to frame Lady Li
for practicing forbidden witchcraft?

348
00:25:54,840 --> 00:25:55,920
How…

349
00:25:56,600 --> 00:25:57,800
How could…

350
00:25:57,880 --> 00:25:58,880
How could this happen?

351
00:26:02,160 --> 00:26:04,600
You even gave me a Blessing Talisman.

352
00:26:05,400 --> 00:26:08,240
So it seems you planned to accuse me

353
00:26:08,840 --> 00:26:11,080
for bringing these evil
curses into the palace.

354
00:26:13,920 --> 00:26:14,920
No, Rao!

355
00:26:15,760 --> 00:26:17,440
It wasn't me! I swear!

356
00:26:18,920 --> 00:26:19,960
It was Mo…

357
00:26:24,960 --> 00:26:26,120
I thought…

358
00:26:27,480 --> 00:26:30,360
Rao, I never meant to hurt you.

359
00:26:40,760 --> 00:26:42,480
I don't even know this palace maid.

360
00:26:43,840 --> 00:26:45,320
You can't pin this on me.

361
00:26:46,120 --> 00:26:47,680
Whether you know her doesn't matter.

362
00:26:48,360 --> 00:26:49,960
False accusations
are as serious as treason.

363
00:26:50,600 --> 00:26:52,320
Once I report this to His Majesty,

364
00:26:52,840 --> 00:26:54,440
I'll have her sent to
the Commandant's Office.

365
00:26:55,240 --> 00:26:59,160
There, the ruthless interrogator Boyao
will question her personally.

366
00:26:59,760 --> 00:27:02,760
I hear Boyao specializes
in torture by steaming.

367
00:27:03,280 --> 00:27:06,000
Perfect. Let this maid try it first.

368
00:27:06,640 --> 00:27:08,080
He can make the blind see,

369
00:27:08,160 --> 00:27:11,760
the deaf hear, and even the mute speak.

370
00:27:14,840 --> 00:27:15,760
You! Come forward!

371
00:27:15,840 --> 00:27:18,160
I was forced into it!
I'll tell you everything!

372
00:27:18,240 --> 00:27:20,400
Lady Li, please spare my life!
Please spare me, Lady Li!

373
00:27:21,000 --> 00:27:25,120
Rao. I swear to heaven
I never meant you any harm.

374
00:27:25,720 --> 00:27:26,920
My mother-in-law only told me

375
00:27:27,520 --> 00:27:30,840
that this blessing talisman
could help you and your mother reconcile.

376
00:27:31,560 --> 00:27:34,440
I thought I'd be doing a good deed.

377
00:27:34,520 --> 00:27:36,520
I never imagined it would cause
so much trouble.

378
00:27:36,600 --> 00:27:37,880
Please believe me, Rao!

379
00:27:37,960 --> 00:27:39,760
Why are you crying?

380
00:27:40,360 --> 00:27:41,800
You're all spineless cowards!

381
00:27:43,080 --> 00:27:44,560
Weren't you going to report me?

382
00:27:44,640 --> 00:27:45,560
Go ahead! Do it now!

383
00:27:46,360 --> 00:27:49,240
I refuse to believe
that some lowly palace maid

384
00:27:49,320 --> 00:27:52,200
could bring me down with a few words!

385
00:27:52,280 --> 00:27:55,600
The Zheng family
is powerful and influential.

386
00:27:55,680 --> 00:27:57,680
Lady Zheng is used to getting your way.

387
00:27:57,760 --> 00:27:59,360
Who would dare hold you accountable?

388
00:28:00,080 --> 00:28:04,680
But right now, His Majesty
is about to choose a crown prince.

389
00:28:05,440 --> 00:28:07,600
I wonder if the Empress and the Han family

390
00:28:07,680 --> 00:28:09,480
will seize this chance
to make things worse.

391
00:28:09,560 --> 00:28:11,320
And what about Lady Wang and Prince Fu?

392
00:28:11,920 --> 00:28:13,880
Will they take advantage of your downfall?

393
00:28:22,120 --> 00:28:23,880
You planned all of this.

394
00:28:31,880 --> 00:28:33,040
Let's go.

395
00:28:33,120 --> 00:28:34,760
Spare me, Your Ladyship!

396
00:28:35,760 --> 00:28:36,920
Don't worry, Shu.

397
00:28:37,680 --> 00:28:39,440
Lady Li is generous and forgiving.

398
00:28:39,960 --> 00:28:42,120
She didn't drag the maid
before His Majesty

399
00:28:42,200 --> 00:28:44,800
because she cares
about Prince Duan's reputation.

400
00:28:51,320 --> 00:28:52,200
No wonder.

401
00:28:53,280 --> 00:28:55,000
I knew this plan to lure the culprit out

402
00:28:55,600 --> 00:28:57,440
wasn't something Lady Li
would come up with.

403
00:28:58,200 --> 00:29:00,280
Whenever she feels slighted,

404
00:29:00,360 --> 00:29:03,720
she runs to His Majesty and acts helpless.

405
00:29:03,800 --> 00:29:05,000
She's so used to being spoiled

406
00:29:06,040 --> 00:29:08,040
that she'd never hold her anger
in for this long.

407
00:29:08,960 --> 00:29:12,440
You've certainly outdone your elders.

408
00:29:13,040 --> 00:29:16,720
Compared to your mother,
you're a little more capable.

409
00:29:21,240 --> 00:29:23,440
DEW AND BLOSSOMS

410
00:29:23,520 --> 00:29:24,880
You're too kind, Your Ladyship.

411
00:29:25,920 --> 00:29:28,600
My younger brother
has always been a troublemaker.

412
00:29:28,680 --> 00:29:29,680
He's no good at books or fighting.

413
00:29:30,520 --> 00:29:31,840
As for the crown prince's position,

414
00:29:35,040 --> 00:29:37,560
Prince Duan is clearly the only choice.

415
00:29:41,360 --> 00:29:43,640
Lady Li would gladly lend her support.

416
00:29:43,720 --> 00:29:44,560
But…

417
00:29:46,440 --> 00:29:47,560
But what?

418
00:29:47,640 --> 00:29:49,360
The Empress rules over the inner palace.

419
00:29:50,040 --> 00:29:52,240
The Han family fully supports Prince Jing,

420
00:29:52,320 --> 00:29:54,320
and the Empress Dowager backs him, too.

421
00:29:54,400 --> 00:29:56,280
So the crown prince's position…

422
00:29:56,360 --> 00:29:57,680
The Empress…

423
00:29:58,480 --> 00:30:02,080
Noble Lady Wu'an,
you certainly hold a grudge.

424
00:30:06,440 --> 00:30:11,120
I wonder, though,
what you think, Lady Zheng.

425
00:30:12,680 --> 00:30:13,520
I…

426
00:30:20,520 --> 00:30:24,320
Of course we should join forces,
dear sister.

427
00:30:34,200 --> 00:30:37,040
Your cousin is so cunning,
yet you saw none of it!

428
00:30:37,560 --> 00:30:38,880
You've brought shame upon Mother.

429
00:30:39,480 --> 00:30:40,800
Apologize to her at once!

430
00:30:43,880 --> 00:30:46,800
It was my carelessness.
Please forgive me, Mother.

431
00:30:46,880 --> 00:30:47,960
Please forgive me!

432
00:30:48,880 --> 00:30:51,600
Enough. Spare your hands.

433
00:30:53,480 --> 00:30:56,080
Mother, do you mean we're really
going to ally ourselves with them?

434
00:30:56,680 --> 00:30:57,800
After they played us for fools?

435
00:31:01,520 --> 00:31:02,720
My son is a man of rare talent,

436
00:31:03,320 --> 00:31:04,320
truly born to stand above the rest.

437
00:31:04,920 --> 00:31:07,280
Who else deserves
to be crown prince but you?

438
00:31:08,480 --> 00:31:11,240
If I must suffer a little humiliation
for your sake,

439
00:31:11,320 --> 00:31:12,280
what does it matter?

440
00:31:13,840 --> 00:31:17,600
Once you become crown prince,
we'll have our chance to settle the score.

441
00:31:18,600 --> 00:31:19,600
I knew it.

442
00:31:20,600 --> 00:31:23,040
You're the only person in this world
who truly cares about me, Mother.

443
00:31:25,080 --> 00:31:28,160
As for everyone else,
I can't count on them at all.

444
00:31:30,400 --> 00:31:33,120
Did Noble Lady Wu'an say
what we should do next?

445
00:31:34,360 --> 00:31:38,080
They said the Zheng family
should hold off for now.

446
00:31:38,160 --> 00:31:40,920
Let the court officials recommend
Prince Jing as crown prince.

447
00:31:41,000 --> 00:31:43,080
Recommend my eldest brother
as crown prince?

448
00:31:43,720 --> 00:31:44,560
Did she really say that?

449
00:31:57,400 --> 00:31:58,320
Keep up. Hurry.

450
00:32:22,840 --> 00:32:24,040
Lord Han.

451
00:32:25,240 --> 00:32:27,440
They carried seven or eight chests
out of the cellar.

452
00:32:27,520 --> 00:32:28,920
Every chest was heavy.

453
00:32:29,000 --> 00:32:30,320
Aman was there to receive them,

454
00:32:30,400 --> 00:32:32,240
and they took everything
into the storeroom.

455
00:32:32,320 --> 00:32:34,320
- Are you certain?
- I saw it myself, my lord.

456
00:32:34,400 --> 00:32:35,240
I wouldn't dare lie.

457
00:32:37,080 --> 00:32:40,680
I remember
Noble Lady Wu'an took in some refugees

458
00:32:40,760 --> 00:32:42,200
and earned praise from the court.

459
00:32:42,800 --> 00:32:45,080
His Majesty even granted her money
and grain from the treasury.

460
00:32:45,160 --> 00:32:46,080
That's right.

461
00:32:47,800 --> 00:32:50,280
Since I can't get my gold back,

462
00:32:50,360 --> 00:32:52,600
I might as well put it to good use.

463
00:32:55,040 --> 00:33:00,560
Noble Lady Wu'an, my family's fortune
isn't yours for the taking.

464
00:33:01,480 --> 00:33:04,200
Lord Han, you promised me yourself

465
00:33:04,280 --> 00:33:07,000
that you'd make me your concubine
once this was done.

466
00:33:07,640 --> 00:33:10,000
I'll serve you faithfully from then on.

467
00:33:11,480 --> 00:33:13,520
That depends on

468
00:33:14,400 --> 00:33:16,480
how well you carry out your task.

469
00:33:17,480 --> 00:33:19,360
I'll do everything I can, My Lord.

470
00:33:25,360 --> 00:33:26,200
COMMANDANT'S OFFICE

471
00:33:26,280 --> 00:33:29,520
- What's she beating that drum for?
- Yeah, what's this about?

472
00:33:29,600 --> 00:33:31,000
- What happened to her?
- Right.

473
00:33:31,080 --> 00:33:32,200
What happened?

474
00:33:33,840 --> 00:33:35,520
My lord, that's her.

475
00:33:37,800 --> 00:33:40,320
My lord! I wish to accuse
Noble Lady Wu'an, Wei Rao,

476
00:33:40,400 --> 00:33:42,440
of outrageous greed
and stealing relief funds and grain!

477
00:33:42,520 --> 00:33:44,560
- How can she do such a thing?
- Really? Is she?

478
00:33:44,640 --> 00:33:46,640
I knew it. She's skimming off our money.

479
00:33:46,720 --> 00:33:48,280
- Exactly!
- How awful!

480
00:33:49,400 --> 00:33:52,400
Your Majesty, wise rulers have always
put the realm's welfare first.

481
00:33:53,000 --> 00:33:55,040
They know the succession must come first.

482
00:33:55,120 --> 00:33:57,360
A rightful heir
gives the people peace of mind.

483
00:33:57,440 --> 00:33:59,520
Prince Jing is Your Majesty's eldest son.

484
00:33:59,600 --> 00:34:01,600
He is kind, humble, frugal,
and devoted to his people.

485
00:34:02,200 --> 00:34:05,480
I humbly ask Your Majesty
to heed the people's wishes

486
00:34:05,560 --> 00:34:07,280
and name Prince Jing crown prince,

487
00:34:07,360 --> 00:34:10,960
securing the throne
and reassuring the people.

488
00:34:13,239 --> 00:34:16,719
Who else among you
supports Prince Jing as crown prince?

489
00:34:16,800 --> 00:34:20,360
We all support Prince Jing!

490
00:34:21,520 --> 00:34:25,280
You mean you advised
the Zheng family to stay out of it

491
00:34:26,040 --> 00:34:29,639
and let the ministers
push for the Empress's son?

492
00:34:30,320 --> 00:34:33,000
His Majesty is blessed
by heaven and still in his prime.

493
00:34:33,840 --> 00:34:35,120
He's in no hurry to name an heir.

494
00:34:35,800 --> 00:34:38,840
The harder they push,
the angrier he'll become.

495
00:34:42,760 --> 00:34:45,280
Naming a crown prince
is a matter of great importance.

496
00:34:45,360 --> 00:34:47,760
We shall discuss it another day.

497
00:34:49,560 --> 00:34:50,960
Do you have anything else to report?

498
00:34:54,040 --> 00:34:57,480
Your Majesty, Noble Lady Wu'an
is arrogant and overbearing.

499
00:34:57,560 --> 00:34:58,480
She abuses her power without restraint.

500
00:34:58,560 --> 00:35:00,760
She secretly tortured her maid, Gejin.

501
00:35:00,840 --> 00:35:03,080
Covered in wounds,
Gejin fled to the Commandant's Office.

502
00:35:03,160 --> 00:35:05,040
She publicly accused her mistress

503
00:35:05,120 --> 00:35:08,360
of stealing the court's
disaster relief funds and grain.

504
00:35:08,960 --> 00:35:11,120
Lord Han failed to
win Noble Lady Wu'an's hand

505
00:35:11,200 --> 00:35:12,960
and was wounded by
the Thousand-Bolt Crossbow.

506
00:35:13,600 --> 00:35:15,520
He must still hold a grudge.

507
00:35:15,600 --> 00:35:16,560
Now, without a shred of evidence,

508
00:35:17,160 --> 00:35:18,680
he accuses Her Ladyship
of stealing relief supplies.

509
00:35:19,280 --> 00:35:21,680
One might suspect he's seeking revenge

510
00:35:22,280 --> 00:35:24,200
and question his integrity as an official.

511
00:35:24,840 --> 00:35:25,840
Your Majesty.

512
00:35:25,920 --> 00:35:28,120
I speak only in the interest of justice,
with no personal grudge.

513
00:35:28,840 --> 00:35:31,280
Your Majesty granted relief funds
to help those in need.

514
00:35:31,360 --> 00:35:35,200
If someone truly dared
to line their pockets with that money,

515
00:35:35,800 --> 00:35:37,760
even a hundred executions
wouldn't be enough!

516
00:35:38,480 --> 00:35:41,760
Your Majesty, don't believe
these baseless accusations!

517
00:35:41,840 --> 00:35:42,920
Your Majesty!

518
00:35:43,000 --> 00:35:45,000
Hundreds of refugees have gathered
at the Commandant's Office,

519
00:35:45,080 --> 00:35:45,920
causing an uproar.

520
00:35:46,600 --> 00:35:48,360
Rumors are spreading
throughout the capital.

521
00:35:48,960 --> 00:35:52,120
I request permission
to take troops to Zhuyu Estate.

522
00:35:52,200 --> 00:35:54,320
If Noble Lady Wu'an is truly innocent,

523
00:35:54,400 --> 00:35:59,120
we can clear her name before everyone
and put the people at ease.

524
00:36:01,640 --> 00:36:03,040
Qi Zhongkai.

525
00:36:03,120 --> 00:36:05,000
Take troops with Han Liao
and accompany the Commandant

526
00:36:05,080 --> 00:36:06,320
to investigate this matter.

527
00:36:06,920 --> 00:36:07,960
As you command.

528
00:36:14,800 --> 00:36:17,200
ZHUYU ESTATE

529
00:36:19,960 --> 00:36:20,800
It's all in there.

530
00:36:20,880 --> 00:36:22,680
I saw it with my own eyes.

531
00:36:22,760 --> 00:36:26,240
They exchanged the stolen relief funds
and grain for gold bars.

532
00:36:26,320 --> 00:36:28,480
You shameless wretch.

533
00:36:28,560 --> 00:36:29,520
Her Ladyship has always treated you well.

534
00:36:30,120 --> 00:36:31,800
How dare you betray her
and falsely accuse your mistress?

535
00:36:33,040 --> 00:36:36,280
Whether I am telling the truth
will be clear once we open the storeroom.

536
00:36:37,440 --> 00:36:38,800
Her Ladyship receives
only a modest allowance.

537
00:36:39,400 --> 00:36:41,120
How could she have a treasury?

538
00:36:41,200 --> 00:36:44,160
My lord. There's a whole mountain
of coins inside.

539
00:36:44,800 --> 00:36:45,840
Break it open!

540
00:36:50,120 --> 00:36:51,760
Do you think the people will believe

541
00:36:52,360 --> 00:36:57,040
that the kind and generous
Noble Lady Wu'an is innocent?

542
00:36:57,120 --> 00:36:58,480
No one will believe her now.

543
00:36:59,920 --> 00:37:02,000
From now on, every coin in her storeroom

544
00:37:02,080 --> 00:37:04,080
will be seen as wealth
wrung from the poor,

545
00:37:04,680 --> 00:37:06,120
stolen from disaster relief funds.

546
00:37:06,200 --> 00:37:10,400
Her spotless reputation
will be stained beyond repair.

547
00:37:11,280 --> 00:37:15,440
And this refuge she worked so hard
and sacrificed so much to build

548
00:37:16,360 --> 00:37:19,880
will be destroyed by vicious rumors
and reduced to nothing in an instant.

549
00:37:20,760 --> 00:37:23,520
All because of that gold and money,

550
00:37:24,720 --> 00:37:27,080
she'll lose the people's trust
and become a public enemy.

551
00:37:27,680 --> 00:37:28,800
Han Liao.

552
00:37:29,480 --> 00:37:31,320
How utterly despicable you are.

553
00:37:32,280 --> 00:37:33,160
And how cruel.

554
00:37:34,640 --> 00:37:36,280
The refugees have nowhere else to go.

555
00:37:36,840 --> 00:37:38,760
And you want to destroy their only home!

556
00:37:38,840 --> 00:37:40,280
You see right through me.

557
00:37:41,000 --> 00:37:42,520
Just what I'd expect from Lord Lu.

558
00:37:43,120 --> 00:37:44,960
She has only herself
to blame for rejecting me

559
00:37:45,040 --> 00:37:48,240
- and wasting my sincere affection!
- You shameless

560
00:37:48,320 --> 00:37:49,840
despicable cur!

561
00:37:50,440 --> 00:37:54,640
What a cur can't have,
he'll destroy completely!

562
00:37:55,240 --> 00:37:56,400
Found it! We found it!

563
00:38:09,240 --> 00:38:11,480
Lord Commandant, take a look.

564
00:38:12,320 --> 00:38:15,520
Everyone here,
come and see for yourselves!

565
00:38:17,720 --> 00:38:19,120
Look at this Noble Lady Wu'an,

566
00:38:19,200 --> 00:38:21,480
so kind to the poor and elderly,
practically a saint!

567
00:38:22,080 --> 00:38:24,840
See how much she's stolen from the people!

568
00:38:56,680 --> 00:38:57,680
Look closely.

569
00:38:58,440 --> 00:39:00,720
Are these gold bars or copper coins?

570
00:39:01,240 --> 00:39:02,360
You scoundrel, Han.

571
00:39:03,240 --> 00:39:05,600
Is this the fortune you claim
she stole from the people?

572
00:39:18,120 --> 00:39:20,200
Open it! Open every last one!

573
00:39:30,360 --> 00:39:32,840
Noble Lady Wu'an, what… What are these?

574
00:39:33,440 --> 00:39:34,920
Winters are long and bitterly cold.

575
00:39:35,640 --> 00:39:37,440
The refugees don't have enough
warm clothing.

576
00:39:37,520 --> 00:39:39,720
Noble Lady Wu'an entrusted
Princess Consort Duan

577
00:39:39,800 --> 00:39:41,440
to collect those from noble households.

578
00:39:42,240 --> 00:39:45,440
The ladies also generously donated
old jewelry, antiques, and ornaments.

579
00:39:46,040 --> 00:39:49,720
The stolen goods aren't in the storeroom
because you knew we were coming!

580
00:39:50,320 --> 00:39:52,360
My men have been guarding
the estate's entrance.

581
00:39:52,960 --> 00:39:55,320
There's no way
you could've taken the money out.

582
00:39:55,400 --> 00:39:57,360
Search the whole estate,
and we'll find it.

583
00:39:58,400 --> 00:40:00,080
Search! Keep searching!

584
00:40:01,360 --> 00:40:02,200
Lord Bo.

585
00:40:07,040 --> 00:40:08,600
I found a cellar.

586
00:40:08,680 --> 00:40:10,040
There's a secret passage inside.

587
00:40:16,720 --> 00:40:17,800
Everyone, follow me!

588
00:40:20,160 --> 00:40:21,280
This way, please.

589
00:40:39,640 --> 00:40:43,080
<i>Wei Rao, you may have hidden</i>
<i>or moved the gold,</i>

590
00:40:43,600 --> 00:40:46,080
<i>but could you move</i>
<i>an entire mountain of copper coins?</i>

591
00:40:47,040 --> 00:40:47,960
Noble Lady Wu'an,

592
00:40:48,600 --> 00:40:50,280
what do you have to say for yourself?

593
00:40:50,360 --> 00:40:51,800
With your modest allowance,

594
00:40:51,880 --> 00:40:53,560
how could you possibly amass
such a fortune?

595
00:40:54,400 --> 00:40:57,080
There's a treasury
beneath the estate's cellar?

596
00:40:58,760 --> 00:40:59,680
I truly knew nothing about it.

597
00:41:00,440 --> 00:41:01,680
My lord, don't believe her.

598
00:41:02,360 --> 00:41:04,800
Her Ladyship ordered the cellar to be dug.

599
00:41:04,880 --> 00:41:08,200
The relief funds and grain she stole
were all hidden down there.

600
00:41:08,280 --> 00:41:11,080
That mountain of copper coins
is proof of her crimes.

601
00:41:19,600 --> 00:41:21,680
Lord Bo, while we were digging,

602
00:41:21,760 --> 00:41:23,440
our shovels struck something
that sounded hollow.

603
00:41:23,520 --> 00:41:26,640
I had the men move the pile of coins
and dig deeper.

604
00:41:26,720 --> 00:41:28,600
We found another chamber,
hidden extremely well.

605
00:41:29,200 --> 00:41:32,080
Inside were 120 suits of armor.

606
00:41:36,040 --> 00:41:37,720
Armor hidden beneath the cellar?

607
00:41:38,520 --> 00:41:40,960
Noble Lady Wu'an,
nobles may keep private guards

608
00:41:41,040 --> 00:41:43,320
to manage estates and maintain order.

609
00:41:43,400 --> 00:41:46,040
In wartime,
they must also fight for the realm.

610
00:41:46,720 --> 00:41:48,280
But the court has long forbidden

611
00:41:48,360 --> 00:41:50,880
the private manufacture
or sale of armor and shields.

612
00:41:50,960 --> 00:41:53,600
Possessing just five suits of armor
is punishable by hanging.

613
00:41:53,680 --> 00:41:56,680
This is high treason!

614
00:41:58,040 --> 00:41:59,040
What armor?

615
00:42:00,320 --> 00:42:03,320
I didn't even know there was a treasury
beneath the cellar.

616
00:42:03,400 --> 00:42:05,240
How could I be plotting treason?

617
00:42:05,320 --> 00:42:06,600
I'm just a woman.

618
00:42:06,680 --> 00:42:08,960
Why would I rebel? What rebellion?

619
00:42:10,280 --> 00:42:12,240
Lord Lu, General Qi,

620
00:42:12,320 --> 00:42:14,200
you must testify on my behalf!

621
00:42:14,280 --> 00:42:15,200
I've been falsely accused!

622
00:42:21,560 --> 00:42:25,280
Han Liao. This is fish-scale armor
laced with iron and bronze fittings.

623
00:42:26,160 --> 00:42:28,200
It even bears your family's crest.

624
00:42:28,280 --> 00:42:30,480
This estate once belonged to you.

625
00:42:31,080 --> 00:42:34,480
The one plotting treason is clearly you.

626
00:42:35,120 --> 00:42:36,080
You've framed me!

627
00:42:38,120 --> 00:42:39,640
Seize this traitor at once!

628
00:42:43,920 --> 00:42:46,760
I've always been loyal to His Majesty.
It's you!

629
00:42:47,560 --> 00:42:49,800
You've conspired to frame me!

630
00:42:50,440 --> 00:42:52,920
Your Ladyship! Your Ladyship!

631
00:42:53,520 --> 00:42:55,480
I… The Han family deceived me.

632
00:42:55,560 --> 00:42:56,520
Please, Your Ladyship,

633
00:42:56,600 --> 00:42:59,720
for the sake of the years I've served you,
spare my life!

634
00:43:00,400 --> 00:43:05,000
Before Chilan died,
do you think she was also praying

635
00:43:06,000 --> 00:43:07,720
that her killer would spare her life?

636
00:43:08,520 --> 00:43:10,120
Your life matters,

637
00:43:11,440 --> 00:43:13,600
but Chilan deserved to die?

638
00:43:13,680 --> 00:43:16,240
You betrayed your mistress.
You shameless wretch.

639
00:43:16,320 --> 00:43:17,920
How dare you beg for mercy?

640
00:43:18,680 --> 00:43:20,520
Your Ladyship, I know I was wrong!

641
00:43:20,600 --> 00:43:21,840
I don't want to die!

642
00:43:21,920 --> 00:43:23,120
Please spare my life, Your Ladyship!

643
00:43:23,200 --> 00:43:24,320
Seize her!

644
00:43:24,400 --> 00:43:26,240
Your Ladyship, please spare me!

645
00:43:26,320 --> 00:43:28,320
Your Ladyship! I don't want to die!

646
00:43:28,400 --> 00:43:30,280
- Save those words…
- Please spare me, Your Ladyship!

647
00:43:30,360 --> 00:43:32,480
And explain yourself to Chilan
in the afterlife.

648
00:43:33,880 --> 00:43:35,120
This case is extremely serious.

649
00:43:35,200 --> 00:43:37,880
His Majesty may wish
to question you himself.

650
00:43:37,960 --> 00:43:41,400
Noble Lady Wu'an, please accompany us
to the Commandant's Office.

651
00:43:42,680 --> 00:43:43,760
Rest assured.

652
00:43:44,560 --> 00:43:46,880
Everyone knows Lord Bo
upholds the law without favor.

653
00:43:47,680 --> 00:43:48,800
He never favors nobles
or imperial relatives.

654
00:43:49,400 --> 00:43:50,880
I'm sure he'll judge this case fairly.

655
00:43:53,000 --> 00:43:55,920
- Lord Bo, I'll go with you.
- This way, Your Ladyship.

656
00:44:05,280 --> 00:44:08,480
Looks like Han Liao has finally
fallen into his own trap.

657
00:44:08,560 --> 00:44:10,680
He got what he deserved!

658
00:44:10,760 --> 00:44:12,320
Don't celebrate just yet.

659
00:44:12,400 --> 00:44:14,560
The Han family won't go down so easily.

660
00:44:16,400 --> 00:44:18,280
We still have a tough fight ahead.

661
00:44:21,080 --> 00:44:23,880
Mother kindly tried to arrange a marriage
for Noble Lady Wu'an,

662
00:44:24,400 --> 00:44:26,240
yet she had the nerve to reject it.

663
00:44:28,360 --> 00:44:32,920
Raised by that nursemaid's daughter,
she was born lowly.

664
00:44:33,000 --> 00:44:34,080
She doesn't know what's good for her.

665
00:44:34,680 --> 00:44:35,720
Don't worry, Mother.

666
00:44:36,240 --> 00:44:38,040
Once I become crown prince,

667
00:44:38,120 --> 00:44:40,280
I'll deal with that mother and daughter.

668
00:44:41,040 --> 00:44:42,840
Your father is still alive.

669
00:44:43,680 --> 00:44:45,320
Even if you become crown prince,

670
00:44:46,000 --> 00:44:49,000
what can you do to those two witches?

671
00:44:49,080 --> 00:44:50,880
They say the Emperor will live forever.

672
00:44:51,480 --> 00:44:54,080
But no emperor can truly live
for thousands of years.

673
00:44:55,360 --> 00:44:58,600
Father will grow old eventually.

674
00:44:58,680 --> 00:45:01,480
I may be Empress and mother of the realm,

675
00:45:01,560 --> 00:45:03,240
but all these years,

676
00:45:03,760 --> 00:45:05,960
His Majesty has always favored Lady Zhou.

677
00:45:06,040 --> 00:45:07,720
I've endured so much ridicule
because of it.

678
00:45:08,440 --> 00:45:09,720
One day,

679
00:45:09,800 --> 00:45:10,800
GRACIOUS BLESSINGS

680
00:45:10,880 --> 00:45:13,560
when our time finally comes,

681
00:45:15,080 --> 00:45:17,680
I'll strip her of her fine clothes
and jewelry.

682
00:45:17,760 --> 00:45:19,480
You'd better make me proud.

683
00:45:24,720 --> 00:45:27,680
These are all gifts
the ministers have sent me.

684
00:45:28,360 --> 00:45:30,800
It's clear who the court supports.

685
00:45:31,680 --> 00:45:33,920
Your wish will soon come true, Mother.

686
00:45:34,680 --> 00:45:40,520
As for Noble Lady Wu'an,
I have a way to avenge you right now.

687
00:45:41,120 --> 00:45:42,880
Doesn't she love taking in refugees?

688
00:45:43,800 --> 00:45:46,960
I hear leprosy is spreading
through a village in Beihan.

689
00:45:48,240 --> 00:45:49,720
One little mistake,

690
00:45:50,600 --> 00:45:52,760
and she'll be covered in festering sores.

691
00:45:53,320 --> 00:45:56,920
That filthy, stinking refugee camp
will have to be burned to the ground!

692
00:46:00,800 --> 00:46:03,480
Think carefully before you make your move,
dear sister.

693
00:46:11,600 --> 00:46:12,960
I won! I won!

694
00:46:13,560 --> 00:46:15,600
Lady Zheng, luck is on your side today.

695
00:46:15,680 --> 00:46:18,120
It seems your wishes
are about to come true.

696
00:46:18,720 --> 00:46:21,520
I can't match your beauty, dear sister,

697
00:46:21,600 --> 00:46:23,160
or your endless favor with His Majesty.

698
00:46:24,000 --> 00:46:26,720
Fortunately, I have a son I can rely on.

699
00:46:27,440 --> 00:46:29,360
Heaven has blessed me in that regard.

700
00:46:33,400 --> 00:46:36,160
Mother. Everything is arranged.

701
00:46:42,640 --> 00:46:43,760
JIAOFANG PALACE

702
00:46:43,840 --> 00:46:45,680
Your Majesty, Your Highness!
Look at the sky!

703
00:46:45,760 --> 00:46:47,000
A heavenly omen has appeared!

704
00:46:50,360 --> 00:46:53,280
Your Majesty, cranes have arrived
in this age of peace!

705
00:46:53,360 --> 00:46:55,400
Surely this is a sign of great fortune!

706
00:46:55,480 --> 00:46:57,520
Your Majesty's kindness
and Prince Jing's wisdom

707
00:46:57,600 --> 00:46:59,320
have earned heaven's favor
and brought this blessing!

708
00:47:00,680 --> 00:47:04,680
Congratulations,
Your Majesty and Your Highness!

709
00:47:05,280 --> 00:47:07,520
I've prayed every day

710
00:47:07,600 --> 00:47:09,880
for peace and prosperity
throughout the realm!

711
00:47:09,960 --> 00:47:13,840
Heaven has finally heard my prayers
and sent us this wonderful sign!

712
00:47:14,440 --> 00:47:15,960
Hurry! Tell His Majesty!

713
00:47:16,040 --> 00:47:18,160
No. This is a blessing from heaven.

714
00:47:18,760 --> 00:47:20,760
I'll bring Father the good news myself!

715
00:47:20,840 --> 00:47:23,200
JIAOFANG PALACE

716
00:47:23,880 --> 00:47:26,680
Could my lifelong wish finally
be coming true?

717
00:47:31,760 --> 00:47:33,760
Your Majesty, I'm innocent!

718
00:47:34,840 --> 00:47:38,400
Lu Zhuo and Noble Lady Wu'an
planted false evidence to frame me!

719
00:47:39,440 --> 00:47:42,680
I wouldn't dare hide armor illegally,
no matter how bold I was!

720
00:47:42,760 --> 00:47:45,240
- That cellar was…
- Dug by your Han family exactly!

721
00:47:48,760 --> 00:47:49,760
Your Majesty!

722
00:47:50,560 --> 00:47:52,480
That treasury was extremely well hidden,

723
00:47:53,160 --> 00:47:54,640
buried two to three zhang underground.

724
00:47:54,720 --> 00:47:57,360
Its walls were lined
with straw to keep out moisture

725
00:47:57,920 --> 00:47:59,160
and coated with tung oil.

726
00:47:59,840 --> 00:48:02,320
A cellar that large would need
an enormous amount of tung oil.

727
00:48:02,400 --> 00:48:04,200
No one could gather
that much in just a few months.

728
00:48:04,280 --> 00:48:07,120
My estate can barely afford
enough food for winter.

729
00:48:07,200 --> 00:48:08,880
How could I possibly
afford such a project?

730
00:48:11,040 --> 00:48:11,920
Marquis of Xiting.

731
00:48:13,560 --> 00:48:15,280
You disgraceful son!

732
00:48:15,360 --> 00:48:17,680
Our family dug that cellar!

733
00:48:17,760 --> 00:48:19,480
How dare you deny it before His Majesty?

734
00:48:19,560 --> 00:48:21,160
Be quiet!

735
00:48:22,320 --> 00:48:23,840
Forgive me, Your Majesty.

736
00:48:23,920 --> 00:48:25,720
My unworthy son abused his office

737
00:48:26,320 --> 00:48:28,880
to exploit others for profit
and secretly amassed a fortune.

738
00:48:28,960 --> 00:48:30,400
That alone is a serious crime.

739
00:48:30,480 --> 00:48:33,440
Then he quarreled with Noble Lady Wu'an,
bribed her maid,

740
00:48:34,040 --> 00:48:35,400
and framed an innocent woman.

741
00:48:35,480 --> 00:48:38,720
I failed to raise him properly,
and I'm deeply ashamed.

742
00:48:38,800 --> 00:48:43,520
I'm willing to surrender my title
and retire to atone for his crimes!

743
00:48:44,680 --> 00:48:46,600
He hid armor and plotted rebellion.

744
00:48:47,400 --> 00:48:49,080
Losing the title won't make up for that.

745
00:48:49,160 --> 00:48:50,280
You…

746
00:48:50,360 --> 00:48:51,840
Marquis of Xiting, do the laws
of this realm mean nothing to you?

747
00:48:52,440 --> 00:48:53,320
Your Majesty!

748
00:48:53,400 --> 00:48:55,360
The hidden treasury is real,

749
00:48:55,440 --> 00:48:56,960
but the armor accusation
is completely false!

750
00:48:57,800 --> 00:49:02,000
Noble Lady Wu'an learned
the treasury's location from the workers

751
00:49:02,600 --> 00:49:05,040
and deliberately set a trap for me.

752
00:49:05,120 --> 00:49:08,480
They planted that armor themselves!

753
00:49:08,560 --> 00:49:09,920
The estate is short on everything.

754
00:49:10,000 --> 00:49:13,600
If I'd found a fortune,
I'd have claimed it for myself.

755
00:49:14,120 --> 00:49:15,440
Would I sit idle and
await your accusation?

756
00:49:16,040 --> 00:49:17,880
You already got your hands on the gold.

757
00:49:18,960 --> 00:49:20,120
You hid gold, too?

758
00:49:21,240 --> 00:49:23,760
Where? I haven't seen any.

759
00:49:24,560 --> 00:49:25,920
You!

760
00:49:26,000 --> 00:49:27,520
The armor was hidden extremely well.

761
00:49:28,120 --> 00:49:29,600
No ordinary person could've found it.

762
00:49:31,400 --> 00:49:33,760
Lord Han tried to turn things around

763
00:49:34,520 --> 00:49:36,520
by framing Her Ladyship
so he can reclaim the cellar.

764
00:49:37,400 --> 00:49:40,040
But we followed the clues
and dug up the armor.

765
00:49:40,720 --> 00:49:41,840
I'd say

766
00:49:43,920 --> 00:49:45,040
you brought this on yourself.

767
00:49:45,120 --> 00:49:46,600
Lu Zhuo.

768
00:49:48,120 --> 00:49:51,400
You're framing a loyal official
over a personal grudge!

769
00:50:13,680 --> 00:50:14,680
Loyal?

770
00:50:16,160 --> 00:50:19,120
What loyal servant has mountains of gold?

771
00:50:20,040 --> 00:50:23,960
What decent official
robs the poor and lives off their taxes?

772
00:50:24,560 --> 00:50:26,800
You've betrayed your Emperor
and your people.

773
00:50:26,880 --> 00:50:27,920
Han Liao!

774
00:50:28,520 --> 00:50:30,600
- You deserve to die a thousand deaths!
- Your Majesty!

775
00:50:30,680 --> 00:50:34,880
The Lu family is clearly seeking revenge
and eliminating their rivals!

776
00:50:34,960 --> 00:50:36,000
Enough!

777
00:50:36,600 --> 00:50:38,520
You both tell different stories.

778
00:50:38,600 --> 00:50:40,960
How am I supposed to decide?

779
00:50:43,480 --> 00:50:45,240
His Highness Prince Jing has arrived!

780
00:50:52,280 --> 00:50:55,040
Father, your wisdom and blessings
know no bounds.

781
00:50:55,720 --> 00:50:57,480
Just now, heavenly music filled the air,

782
00:50:57,560 --> 00:50:59,040
and cranes descended from the sky.

783
00:50:59,120 --> 00:51:00,680
Above the Jiaofang Palace,

784
00:51:00,760 --> 00:51:03,000
they danced and sang, circling endlessly.

785
00:51:03,080 --> 00:51:04,840
Such an omen is seen once in a century.

786
00:51:05,440 --> 00:51:08,280
It signals wise leadership
and an era of peace and prosperity!

787
00:51:08,960 --> 00:51:12,840
You say a divine omen appeared. Where?

788
00:51:12,920 --> 00:51:13,760
Above the Jiaofang Palace.

789
00:51:13,840 --> 00:51:16,640
The sacred cranes
are a blessing upon our dynasty.

790
00:51:16,720 --> 00:51:19,040
Heaven has also blessed
Her Majesty the Empress.

791
00:51:19,120 --> 00:51:21,320
Everyone in the palace witnessed it.

792
00:51:21,400 --> 00:51:23,840
It's a tribute to Mother's virtue
and kindness to all!

793
00:51:26,560 --> 00:51:28,920
It's Heaven rewarding
the Empress's virtue,

794
00:51:29,000 --> 00:51:31,440
or praising you as our wise
future Crown Prince?

795
00:51:32,880 --> 00:51:35,920
I'm unworthy. I'd never covet the throne.

796
00:51:36,000 --> 00:51:38,480
I got carried away.
Please forgive me, Father.

797
00:51:38,560 --> 00:51:39,680
What?

798
00:51:40,480 --> 00:51:43,640
Your Han family hid armor
and staged a divine omen

799
00:51:44,240 --> 00:51:45,840
just to put him on the throne?

800
00:51:45,920 --> 00:51:47,000
- Your Majesty!
- Father!

801
00:51:47,080 --> 00:51:48,360
- I'm innocent!
- I would never dare!

802
00:51:48,960 --> 00:51:49,920
Guards!

803
00:51:50,000 --> 00:51:52,000
Strip Prince Jing of his royal robes!

804
00:51:52,680 --> 00:51:54,120
Throw him in the Commandant's prison

805
00:51:54,920 --> 00:51:56,640
along with the Marquis of Xiting
and his son.

806
00:51:57,280 --> 00:51:59,160
Have Boyao detain and interrogate them!

807
00:51:59,760 --> 00:52:01,680
Confine the Empress
to her Jiaofang Palace!

808
00:52:02,280 --> 00:52:04,280
No one is to be released without my order!

809
00:52:04,360 --> 00:52:06,720
Father, I'm innocent!

810
00:52:07,240 --> 00:52:08,560
I've been framed, Father!

811
00:52:09,240 --> 00:52:11,280
Father, I… I'm innocent!

812
00:52:11,360 --> 00:52:13,200
I'm innocent!

813
00:52:14,320 --> 00:52:15,840
- Father!
- Your Majesty, I'm innocent!

814
00:52:15,920 --> 00:52:17,960
I'm innocent, Father!

815
00:52:19,360 --> 00:52:20,760
Father!

816
00:54:35,600 --> 00:54:38,160
‪NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‪IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
